- The integer array parameter `digits` must not be null.
- The length of the integer array parameter `digits` is greater than or equal to 1 and is less than or equal to 100.
- All values in the integer array parameter `digits` are greater than or equal to 0 and are less than or equal to 9.
- The length of the integer array result is equal to the length of the integer array parameter `digits` or is greater by 1.
- The integer array result represents the large integer obtained by incrementing the integer array parameter `digits` by one.